  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Governace and Economic Management Support (GEMS) - Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Governance &amp; Economic Management Support (GEMS) Project is envision to contribute towards setting South Sudan on a pathway to sustainable peace, stability, development and well-being for its citizens through strengthening capacity of key national institutions for effective and accountable implementation of the R-ARCSS provisions.</narrative>
  </description>
